  "name": "74HC85 4-bit magnitude comparator",
  "category": "logic",
  "description": "4-bit magnitude comparator (74HC85): AGTB, AEQB and ALTB compare A3-A0 with B3-B0; when they are equal the cascade inputs IGT, IEQ and ILT decide, so stages chain for wider words.",
